{
	"name": "Banner of Protection",
	"type": "object",
	"img": "icons/sundries/flags/banner-sword-blue.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Thrusting the post of the banner into the ground, you call up a dome of protection over yourself and allies to stop an incoming attack. As a reaction to being targeted by a spell, or within the area of effect of a spell, you can plant your banner into the ground to call up a field of protection in a 10ft radius around your position for up to 1 minute, or until the banner is moved from its location.</p><p>The shield stops spells of 3rd level and lower, even if a higher spell slot is used to cast the spell, and may be used once per short or long rest.</p>",
